sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Shopper / UI
  participant G as Gateway
  participant I as Intent
  participant E as Embedding
  participant R as Retrieval
  participant K as Ranking
  U->>G: Chennai summer cotton dress under 2000
  G->>G: Response-cache lookup
  Note over G,K: On a cache miss
  G->>I: Parse query
  I->>I: Rules extract constraints and context
  opt LLM configured and requested
    I->>I: Validate fresh/cached JSON, then normalize
    I->>I: Preserve rule budget, size, gender and explicit category
  end
  I-->>G: Intent, parser and warnings
  G->>G: Build stock, budget and recognized hard filters
  G->>E: Text vectors, optional query-image vector
  opt Query image supplied
    E->>E: Strict base64, byte/pixel and format checks
  end
  E-->>G: Vectors or explicit image/text fallback
  G->>R: BM25 text, vectors and hard filters
  R->>R: Filter-aware BM25 + Qdrant, RRF candidate fusion
  R-->>G: Candidates and completed signals
  G->>K: Rank candidates for parsed needs
  K->>K: Recheck constraints, context-adaptive scoring
  K->>K: Build template explanations
  opt LLM explanations enabled
    K->>K: Accept only ordered complete template sentences
    K->>K: Keep template on invalid output
  end
  K-->>G: Products, scores, constraints and explanations
  G-->>U: Results, timings and degraded flags
  Note over G,K: LLM schema validation bounds output, it does not prove semantic correctness
